subject: fix(db): add conversationId column to usageHistory and requestDetails

The branch added conversationId-based queries (getConversationSummary,
getErrorSummary, etc.) but the schema was missing the column. Added
conversationId TEXT to both tables with indexes, bumped SCHEMA_VERSION
to 3.

Also fixed claude-to-kiro.js: expose systemPrompt on payload object
(same bug as openai-to-kiro.js, fixing 9 tests).


